[options]
[A.]
<$Playsound,distantWindQuiet-3000.wav>
<$Playsound,distantWindQuiet-3000.wav>
<$Playsound,forWind2.wav>

    <h2>Slave to the King (Invasion of Windy City)<a href="#mission11">~[IfortGump.46]</a></h2>
                                 ~[IwindVortex.20]
<br>                                                                                  ~1~y<?!{sw_difficulty1}>HARD</?><?{sw_difficulty1}>EASY</?>~.<br>
<br>
<i>I want this Ambassador's head!<br>
                                   ---Hades</i>
<p>
You must now travel to Windy City.<br>
Your mission is to invade them during the midnight hour.<br>
For you will have the element of suprise on your side.
<p>
             <a href="cmd:ShowTechnology,55"> ~[IfortGump.50] </a>                             <a href="cmd:DoNothing,0">~[IfortGump.22] </a>                        <a href="cmd:Tell,guideHades.overview">~[Ipriest.13]</a><br>
<a href="cmd:ShowTechnology,55">Review Knowledge</a>         <a href="cmd:DoNothing,0">Surprise them!</a>        <a href="cmd:Tell,guideHades.overview">I gotta go now</a>
$OnExit= ,Tell,sound1

$Button= ,Tell,A.

[sound1]
<$PlaySound,distantWindQuiet-3000.wav>
<$PlaySound,golemMove2.wav>


[@2]
<$MoveDialog,tr>
OH NO! The enemy has awakened! He sounds the alarm!
<$Playsound,bell.wav>
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0


[@7]
<$PlaySound,bell.wav>


[@12]
<$PlaySound,bell.wav>

[@17]
<$MoveDialog,tr>
<$PlaySound,bell.wav>
Well, so much for surprising them!<br>
To BATTLE, you scream to your allies!
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0

[ai3PriestDead]
Ahh... more storm crystals from the Furies!<br>
{sw_hades} must be pleased!
<$ChangeMoney,5000>
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0

[ai2PriestDead]
One of Hades Henchmen just bit the dust.<br>
You better complete this mission or you'll be next.
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0

[ai4PriestDead]
Another one of Hades henchman just bit the dust. Don't fret, for his soul you will see again.
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0


[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>VICTORY IS YOURS (and {sw_hades}<h2>)! </h2>
                        
~[Ipriest.89]<br>
                      ~[IsunFlyerBomb.14]
<p>
As you make the last sacrifice, you hear a loud tearing, as if
the very fabric of space is being shredded!
<p>
You see before you an opening: first small, then growing very quickly!
Its a bright blue white opening that first surrounds Windy city, then
engulfs it in flames!
<p>
You watch as the once mighty Windy City melts into the ground in front of you!
<p>
An evil laughter can be heard all around you.
Your Master is at play again!<br>
He has taken Windy city to the BOWELS of ~[IsunFlyerBomb.2]~r~BHELL~.~[IsunFlyerBomb.2]
to torment some more helpess souls!
<$Config,sw_difficulty1=0>
<$Config,sw_m13=1>
<$Config,sw_m11=0>
$Button=On to: Rampage of Rain City!,MissionBegin,sw_m13


[Failed]
You receive a message from the Ambassador of Windy City.<br>
                                 ~[IwindFlyer.22]
<p>
<i>"I feel sorry for you priest. <br>
For I know you are under {sw_hades}<i> evil spell."
<p>
"May the Furies have mercy on your soul."</i>
<p>
Forget the mercy. For you belong solely to {sw_hades}.
<p>
You must attack them again even if it is by yourself! For you would
dread going to Hades with news of Failure. Your Master can be very
cruel!
<$Config,sw_mvar0=5000>
<$Config,sw_mvar2=4>
<$Config,sw_mvar3=2>
<$Config,sw_difficulty1=1>
$Button=Try again,MissionBegin,sw_m11

[END]
